🌟 Features That Could Make EduGenie Stand Out
•	"Teach Me Like I'm 10" — simplify any concept.
•	"Teach Me for an Exam" — focus on exam-relevant material.
•	"Socratic Mode" — instead of giving the answer immediately, Gemini asks guiding questions.
•	"Explain My Mistake" — analyze an incorrect answer and explain where the reasoning went wrong.
•	"Study From My Notes" — generate learning content exclusively from uploaded material.
•	"5-Minute Revision" — produce a rapid revision session for a topic.
•	Voice Tutor — conversational learning through speech.
•	Progress Dashboard — visualize learning progress and weak areas.
🎓 Example Project Pitch
EduGenie is a Google Gemini-powered personalized learning assistant that helps students understand concepts, summarize study materials, generate quizzes, prepare for exams, and build personalized study plans. By combining conversational AI with adaptive learning features, EduGenie transforms static educational content into an interactive learning experience.
🔥 MVP for a Student Project
If this is for a hackathon, academic project, or prototype, I'd keep the first version focused:
MVP = 5 modules
1.	🤖 AI Tutor Chat
2.	📄 PDF/Notes Summarizer
3.	❓ AI Quiz Generator
4.	🧠 Personalized Flashcards
5.	📊 Student Progress Dashboard
Then add the study planner, voice tutor, image understanding, and adaptive learning as future enhancements.

